<title>ZIMBABWE:  CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 200 ALL OUT AGAINST ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 200 ALL OUT AGAINST ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were all out for 200 in the second one day international against England at Harare Sports Club on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
